  "trigger": "new_lead_captured",
  "pipeline_email": "bigtruck444@agentmail.to",
  "author": "Bob Mills",
  "books_available": [
    {
      "series": "No Blue Sky",
      "volumes": [
        {"volume": 1, "title": "No Blue Sky: Built from Dust", "price": 9.99},
        {"volume": 2, "title": "No Blue Sky: The Oxygen Gamble", "price": 9.99},
        {"volume": 3, "title": "No Blue Sky: Rivers Under Mars", "price": 9.99},
        {"volume": 4, "title": "No Blue Sky: The Red Charter", "price": 14.99},
        {"volume": 5, "title": "No Blue Sky: The First Martian Nation", "price": 14.99}
      ]
    },
    {
      "series": "Non-Fiction and Memoir",
      "volumes": [
        {"volume": 1, "title": "AI That Works for Small Business", "price": 19.99, "subtitle": "A Practical Playbook for Modern Innovation"},
        {"volume": 2, "title": "Tomorrow is Still Open", "price": 19.99, "subtitle": "A Memoir of Science, Soul, and the Space Between"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bulk_pricing_tiers": [
    {"min_qty": 10, "max_qty": 49, "discount": "10%", "label": "Small Group"},
    {"min_qty": 50, "max_qty": 199, "discount": "20%", "label": "Classroom Set"},
    {"min_qty": 200, "max_qty": 999, "discount": "30%", "label": "Institution Pack"},
    {"min_qty": 1000, "max_qty": null, "discount": "40%", "label": "Wholesale / Distribution"}
  ],
  "emails": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "subject": "Welcome to the world of No Blue Sky, {{name}}!",
      "preheader": "Your free book catalog and introduction inside",
      "template": "welcome_catalog",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nWelcome! I'm Bob Mills, and I'm thrilled to have you here.\n\nWhether you're discovering the No Blue Sky series for the first time or you've heard about it through fellow readers, you're in for a journey. I've poured years of imagination, research, and heart into these stories — and I'm so glad you're giving them a chance.\n\nHere's a look at what's available:\n\n📚 THE NO BLUE SKY SERIES (5 Volumes)\nA gripping science fiction saga that explores what happens when humanity reaches beyond the stars — and finds more questions than answers.\n\nVolume 1: No Blue Sky: Built from Dust — $9.99\nVolume 2: No Blue Sky: The Oxygen Gamble — $9.99\nVolume 3: No Blue Sky: Rivers Under Mars — $9.99\nVolume 4: No Blue Sky: The Red Charter — $14.99\nVolume 5: No Blue Sky: The First Martian Nation — $14.99\n\n📖 NON-FICTION & MEMOIR\nAI That Works for Small Business — $19.99\nA Practical Playbook for Modern Innovation\nTomorrow is Still Open — $19.99\nA Memoir of Science, Soul, and the Space Between\n\nAll books are available individually, and if you're buying for a group — book club, classroom, or team — I offer special bulk pricing:\n\n• 10–49 copies: 10% off\n• 50–199 copies: 20% off\n• 200–999 copies: 30% off\n• 1,000+ copies: 40% off\n\nReply to this email anytime if you have questions about the books, want signed copies, or need help choosing where to start. I read every message personally.\n\nHappy reading,\nBob Mills\n\nP.S. — Over the next couple of weeks, I'll send you a behind-the-scenes look at the stories, early reviews, and a special offer. Keep an eye on your inbox!",
      "call_to_action": {
        "text": "Browse the Full Catalog",
        "link": "mailto:bigtruck444@agentmail.to?subject=Catalog%20Request"
      }
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "subject": "{{name}}, here's the story behind the story",
      "preheader": "How No Blue Sky came to life — plus a free sample chapter",
      "template": "author_story_sample",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nEvery book has a story behind it — and No Blue Sky is no exception.\n\nI didn't set out to write a five-volume science fiction series. It started with a single image that wouldn't leave my head: a person standing on an alien world, looking up at a sky that wasn't blue, feeling utterly alone yet strangely at peace.\n\nThat image became Built from Dust. And once I started writing, the story took on a life of its own. Characters appeared fully formed. Worlds built themselves. What I thought would be a single book became a sprawling saga about courage, identity, and the choices that define us when everything familiar is gone.\n\nI wrote most of No Blue Sky early in the morning, before the day job started. Some chapters were rewritten a dozen times. Others poured out in one sitting, as if they'd been waiting for me to catch up.\n\nTomorrow is Still Open came from a different place entirely — quieter, more personal. It's the book I needed to write when I was figuring out how to start over.\n\n🎁 I'd love to share that experience with you. Reply to this email with the word \"SAMPLE\" and I'll send you a free sample chapter from any book of your choice — no strings attached.\n\nWant to know what happens in the first chapter of Built from Dust? Curious about the opening of Tomorrow is Still Open? Just say the word.\n\nMore soon,\nBob Mills\n\nP.S. — On Day 7, I'll share what early readers and reviewers have been saying. Spoiler: some of it surprised even me.",
      "call_to_action": {
        "text": "Get Your Free Sample Chapter",
        "link": "mailto:bigtruck444@agentmail.to?subject=SAMPLE%20-%20Free%20Chapter%20Request"
      }
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "subject": "What readers are saying about No Blue Sky, {{name}}",
      "preheader": "Early reviews, testimonials, and reader reactions",
      "template": "bestseller_reviews",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nOne of the best parts of being an author is hearing from readers. Every message, every review, every five-star rating reminds me why I do this.\n\nHere's what people are saying about the No Blue Sky series and Tomorrow is Still Open:\n\n⭐ \"Built from Dust grabbed me from the first page and didn't let go. Bob Mills writes with the kind of urgency that makes you forget to eat dinner.\" — Amazon Review\n\n⭐ \"I bought No Blue Sky: The Oxygen Gamble for my son and ended up reading the whole thing myself before he got it back. Now we're both hooked.\" — Sarah M., Book Club Coordinator\n\n⭐ \"Tomorrow is Still Open made me cry in the best way. It's one of those books you finish and then immediately text your best friend about.\" — Goodreads Review\n\n⭐ \"The world-building in this series is incredible. Each volume gets better. The Red Charter (#4) had me pacing my living room during the climax.\" — David L., Sci-Fi Book Club\n\n🏆 The No Blue Sky series has been featured in Indie Sci-Fi Monthly's \"Best of the Year\" roundup and continues to gather momentum among genre fans.\n\nBut don't just take their word for it. The best way to know if these books are for you is to try one yourself.\n\nEvery volume is available as a standalone read — you can jump in anywhere, though most readers start with Built from Dust and work their way forward.\n\n📖 Start reading today:\n• No Blue Sky: Built from Dust — $9.99\n• No Blue Sky: The Oxygen Gamble — $9.99\n• No Blue Sky: Rivers Under Mars — $9.99\n• No Blue Sky: The Red Charter — $14.99\n• No Blue Sky: The First Martian Nation — $14.99\n• Tomorrow is Still Open — $19.99\n• AI That Works for Small Business — $19.99\n\nReply anytime with questions — I'm here to help,\nBob Mills\n\nP.S. — Next week I'll be sending a special limited-time offer your way. If you've been thinking about picking up a copy, that's the week to do it.",
      "call_to_action": {
        "text": "Read the Reviews on Amazon",
        "link": "mailto:bigtruck444@agentmail.to?subject=Book%20Inquiry"
      }
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "subject": "Last chance, {{name}} — limited-time offer inside",
      "preheader": "Special pricing + bulk discounts for a limited time",
      "template": "limited_time_offer",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nThis is the last email in this series, and I want to make it worth your while.\n\nFor the next 7 days, I'm offering a special limited-time discount on all titles:\n\n🎉 15% OFF any single book — just reply with \"ORDER\" and the title you want, and I'll send you a personalized purchase link.\n\nBut here's the real deal: if you're buying for others — a book club, classroom, team, or community group — now is the absolute best time to lock in bulk pricing.\n\n📦 BULK PRICING REMINDER:\n• 10–49 copies → 10% off (Small Group)\n• 50–199 copies → 20% off (Classroom Set)\n• 200–999 copies → 30% off (Institution Pack)\n• 1,000+ copies → 40% off (Wholesale / Distribution)\n\nThese bulk discounts stack with the 15% limited-time offer for an even better deal on larger orders.\n\n💰 Example: A Classroom Set of 50 copies of No Blue Sky: Built from Dust at 20% off + the limited-time bonus = maximum savings.\n\nHere's all you need to do:\n1. Reply to this email with \"ORDER\" and your quantity/titles\n2. I'll respond within 24 hours with your custom quote\n3. You order, I ship, and you get reading 🚀\n\nThis offer expires in 7 days. After that, standard pricing resumes.\n\nI'm so grateful you gave me a chance to share my work with you, {{name}}. Whether you order now or down the road, I hope the stories find you at the right time.\n\nWith gratitude,\nBob Mills\n\nP.S. — Even if this isn't the right time to order, feel free to stay in touch. Reply anytime and I'll add you to my readers list for future releases, exclusive content, and early access to new books.",
      "call_to_action": {
        "text": "Claim Your 15% Discount Now",
        "link": "mailto:bigtruck444@agentmail.to?subject=ORDER%20-%20Limited%20Time%20Offer"
      }
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "timezone": "UTC",
    "send_time": "09:00",
    "track_opens": true,
    "track_clicks": true,
    "unsubscribe_behavior": "reply_to_unsubscribe",
    "max_emails_per_sequence": 4,
    "pause_on_reply": true,
    "resume_if_no_reply_days": 7
  }
}
"}

{"path": "/home/bob/.hermes/.openclaw/workspace/pipeline-engine/sequences/saas-nurture.json", "content": "{
  "pipeline": "SaaS",
  "description": "7-day email nurture sequence for MIFECO SaaS leads. Covers all 3 products: Project Hypatia Pro, PM Accelerator, VibraEngineer. Uses {{name}}, {{company}}, {{product}} placeholders.",
  "email_sequences": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "subject": "Welcome to MIFECO SaaS, {{name}}! Here's what we build",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nThanks for your interest in MIFECO's SaaS tools! We build purpose-built software for engineering and project teams — not generic platforms, but focused solutions that solve real problems.\n\nHere's a quick overview of what we offer:\n\n🚀 **Project Hypatia Pro**\nAI-powered project management designed for engineering teams. Hypothesis-driven workflows, automated risk tracking, and intelligent resource allocation. Built for teams that need more than a to-do list.\n\n⚡ **PM Accelerator**\nA lightweight project management acceleration toolkit. Get teams up and running fast with templates, automated reporting, and simplified workflows. Perfect for teams transitioning from spreadsheets to structured project management.\n\n🔧 **VibraEngineer**\nSpecialized engineering vibration analysis and monitoring platform. Collect, analyze, and visualize vibration data from sensors and field measurements. Purpose-built for mechanical, civil, and aerospace engineers.\n\nWhich of these sounds most relevant to your work at {{company}}? Hit reply and let me know — I can tailor the rest of these emails to your specific needs.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "Reply to tell us your product interest",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "subject": "{{name}}, see Project Hypatia Pro in 2 minutes",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nIf you're managing complex engineering projects, this is for you.\n\n**Project Hypatia Pro** helps teams like yours:\n\n📋 **Hypothesis-Driven Workflows** — Define engineering hypotheses, track validation data, and close the loop with automated testing integration.\n\n📊 **Real-Time Risk Dashboards** — AI flags schedule risks, resource bottlenecks, and dependency conflicts before they become problems.\n\n👥 **Resource Intelligence** — See who's overallocated, where skills are underutilized, and when to staff up — all in one view.\n\n🔄 **Toolchain Integration** — Connect with Jira, GitHub, Slack, and your CI/CD pipeline. No manual data entry.\n\nOur beta users report saving an average of 8 hours per week on project admin alone.\n\n👉 [Watch the 2-Minute Product Tour](https://hypatia.mifeco.com/demo)\n\nWant a personalized walkthrough for your team's specific use case? Reply and we'll set one up.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "Watch Product Tour at https://hypatia.mifeco.com/demo",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "subject": "{{name}}, PM Accelerator — from spreadsheets to structure",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nNot every team needs a full enterprise PMO tool. Sometimes you just need the right structure, fast.\n\n**PM Accelerator** is our answer to that. It's designed for teams who are outgrowing spreadsheets but aren't ready for a heavy project management overhaul:\n\n📁 **Template Library** — Start with pre-built project templates for software, engineering, construction, and product launches. Customize in minutes.\n\n📈 **Automated Reporting** — Generate stakeholder reports, sprint summaries, and burndown charts with one click. No more copy-pasting into PowerPoint.\n\n⏱️ **Time Tracking Light** — Simple, non-intrusive time tracking that actually gets adopted by your team. See where hours are going without the friction of enterprise time systems.\n\n🤝 **Team Collaboration** — Built-in task assignments, comment threads, and file sharing. Everything your team needs in one place.\n\nPM Accelerator is available as a standalone product or as an add-on to Project Hypatia Pro.\n\n👉 [Explore PM Accelerator](https://accelerator.mifeco.com)\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "Explore PM Accelerator at https://accelerator.mifeco.com",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "subject": "VibraEngineer — purpose-built for mechanical & civil engineers",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nIf you work with rotating machinery, structural dynamics, or field vibration measurements, this one's for you.\n\n**VibraEngineer** is the only SaaS platform built specifically for engineering vibration analysis:\n\n📡 **Multi-Source Data Ingestion** — Pull data from field sensors, accelerometers, FFT analyzers, and simulation outputs. CSV, JSON, or API — we speak all formats.\n\n📉 **Frequency Domain Analysis** — Automated FFT, PSD, spectrograms, and order tracking. No more wrestling with MATLAB scripts for basic analysis.\n\n🔍 **Anomaly Detection** — ML-powered pattern recognition flags unusual vibration signatures. Early warning for bearing wear, imbalance, misalignment, and resonance.\n\n📋 **Report Generation** — Export professional vibration analysis reports with your branding. Ready for client delivery or regulatory submission.\n\nSee it in action:\n👉 [VibraEngineer Demo](https://vibraengineer.mifeco.com/demo)\n\nHave a specific data set you'd like us to analyze? Reply and upload it — we'll run a free sample analysis.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "View VibraEngineer Demo at https://vibraengineer.mifeco.com/demo",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "subject": "How teams use MIFECO SaaS — real workflows, real results",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nStill evaluating? Here's how teams are using MIFECO tools in the real world:\n\n**🏗️ Engineering Firm (50 engineers)**\nUses Project Hypatia Pro to manage 12 concurrent projects. Automated risk tracking caught 3 schedule conflicts in the first week. Saved $40K in potential rework costs in month one.\n\n**📊 Growing Tech Company (20 PMs)**\nDeployed PM Accelerator as a lightweight PMO for their software teams. Reduced status meeting time by 60% — all reporting is now automated and consumed async.\n\n**🔧 Mechanical Engineering Consultancy (8 analysts)**\nUses VibraEngineer for field vibration measurements. Cut analysis time per project from 2 days to 3 hours. Now takes on 3x more projects without hiring.\n\n**The common thread:** Each team adopted one product first, then expanded once they saw results.\n\n👉 [Book a No-Pressure Discovery Call](https://mifeco.com/consult)\n\nWe'll help you figure out which tool (or combination) fits your team best. No pitch, just practical advice.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "Book Discovery Call at https://mifeco.com/consult",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "subject": "Pricing & plans — transparent, no hidden fees",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nI know pricing matters, so let's be upfront.\n\n**Project Hypatia Pro**\n• Team: $49/user/month (min 5 users)\n• Business: $39/user/month (min 20 users)\n• Enterprise: Custom pricing with dedicated support\n\n**PM Accelerator**\n• Starter: $19/user/month (up to 10 users)\n• Growth: $14/user/month (up to 50 users)\n• Unlimited: $9/user/month (50+ users)\n\n**VibraEngineer**\n• Analyst: $79/user/month (individual)\n• Team: $59/user/month (2-10 users)\n• Enterprise: Custom pricing with API access & on-prem option\n\nAll plans include:\n✅ 14-day free trial (no credit card)\n✅ Onboarding assistance\n✅ Email & chat support\n✅ Regular feature updates\n\n👉 [Start Your Free Trial](https://mifeco.com/trial)\n\nOr if you have questions about which plan fits your team, just reply — I'll help you figure it out.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
      "cta": "Start Free Trial at https://mifeco.com/trial",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "subject": "{{name}}, let's find the right path forward",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nThis is the last email in this series, and I want to make sure you have everything you need to make a decision.\n\nHere's where you can go from here:\n\n**1. Ready to try?**\nStart a free 14-day trial of any product — no credit card needed.\n👉 [Start Free Trial](https://mifeco.com/trial)\n\n**2. Want to see it first?**\nBook a 20-minute personalized demo. We'll focus on your specific use case.\n👉 [Book a Demo](https://mifeco.com/demo)\n\n**3. Still comparing options?**\nReply to this email and tell me about your team's biggest challenge. I'll send back a tailored recommendation within 24 hours.\n\n**4. Not the right time?**\nNo problem at all. You'll stay on our list for product updates and new features — no spam, just the useful stuff.\n\nWhichever path you choose, I'm glad we connected. The fact that you made it through all 7 emails tells me you're serious about finding the right tools for your team — and that's exactly who we build for.\n\nAll the best,\nThe MIFECO Team\n\nP.S. — Every MIFECO product comes with a 14-day free trial and onboarding support. There's zero risk in giving it a shot.",
      "cta": "Choose Your Path at https://mifeco.com",
      "trigger_condition": "lead_created"
    }
  ]
}
"}
